xt":"props だと、Readonly なのが辛くて","ts":"1634734800.005000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rRovC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d198d426-5c6f-408d-a3b4-e45aec65c1b5","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そうですね。受け取る側はただの変数として受け取ります。","ts":"1634734787.004700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G/C="}]},{"client_msg_id":"099ec351-f843-4c04-9bac-181a050ff6e0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"1コンポーネントでアプリ書けるんですけど、長くなりすぎるの辛いなと思って、部品ごとに分けたんですが","ts":"1634734771.004300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E9P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1ebe4e2-b18d-49b0-8dc0-4e4d9aa121da","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"んー コンポーネント間の値の受け渡しって、State でやるんですかね","ts":"1634734710.002800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P/C72"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7f35e15-0639-4596-a843-cb7653f54e8e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なるほど","ts":"1634734635.001300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L4N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"342d5254-a006-4dc0-ba18-40fabd54f441","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ライブラリーとか書かない限り関数です。","ts":"1634734574.001100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5T2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37d3bd92-eb7a-4271-94b0-54590f116f30","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"今なら関数コンポーネント一択かと","ts":"1634734574.001000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EJZN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69255a9e-bf37-4305-9882-1a3fba684753","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"React やってる人って、関数コンポーネントとクラスコンポーネント、どっちで書くんですかね？","ts":"1634734555.000400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d3i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31976b1d-0f01-411c-aad0-ed223734bcdc","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"記事のやつは型定義 -\u0026gt; 実際のチェックって感じですかね。便利そう","ts":"1634724289.499600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DZtw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6408de2-c591-4650-b931-2c6b66f8bd23","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"```import { ensureLike } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/unknownutil/mod.ts\u003e\";\n\nconst a: unknown = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"];\nensureLike([], a); // Now 'a' is 'unknown[]'\nensureLike([\"\", \"\", \"\"], a); // Now 'a' is '[string, string, string]'\n\nconst b: unknown = { foo: \"foo\", bar: 0 };\nensureLike({}, b); // Now 'b' is 'Record\u0026lt;string, unknown\u0026gt;'\nensureLike({ foo: \"\", bar: 0 }, b); // Now 'b' is '{foo: string, bar: number}'```","ts":"1634724186.499200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+5+C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6969CEEE-2E4E-4D17-89AC-62D3C08596A3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003chttps://zenn.dev/yonajs/articles/dc330d8d81b60f|https://zenn.dev/yonajs/articles/dc330d8d81b60f\u003e\nみんなこういうの好きだなぁって感じだ","ts":"1634723988.498200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Zenn: TypeScriptでObjectの型ガード関数を直感的に定義できるライブラリを作った","id":1,"title":"TypeScriptでObjectの型ガード関数を直感的に定義できるライブラリを作った","title_link":"https://zenn.dev/yonajs/articles/dc330d8d81b60f","image_url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/zenn/image/upload/s--tZZVX-0K--/co_rgb:222%2Cg_south_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_37_bold:yona%2Cx_203%2Cy_98/c_fit%2Cco_rgb:222%2Cg_north_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_65_bold:TypeScript%25E3%2581%25A7Object%25E3%2581%25AE%25E5%259E%258B%25E3%2582%25AC%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2583%2589%25E9%2596%25A2%25E6%2595%25B0%25E3%2582%2592%25E7%259B%25B4%25E6%2584%259F%25E7%259A%2584%25E3%2581%25AB%25E5%25AE%259A